# Pinned upstream mitmproxy standalone (PyInstaller) build used as the secret
# gateway data plane. Shell-sourceable; the installer verifies the archive
# against the checksum for the host architecture before extracting it.
# Upstream publishes no checksum files: these digests were computed from the
# official downloads and must be re-derived when the version changes.
